{"articleNo":"533301","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=533301&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 국립금오공대 재학생 TOEIC Speaking 응시료 할인(30%) 혜택 안내(연 1회 한정)","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2025.08.20","hit":"5447","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(47, 157, 39);\">&lt;국립금오공대 재학생 정기 TOEIC Speaking</span></span><i><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(47, 157, 39);\">&nbsp;</span></i></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(47, 157, 39);\">응시료 30% 할인 혜택 안내&gt;</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.2; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">최근 본교</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;학생들의 어학 능력과 취업역량 강화를 위하여 한국TOEIC</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">위원회와 업무 협약을 맺었습니다. 이에&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.48px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOEIC Speaking</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.48px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">응시료 할인 혜택을 제공하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u>1. 혜택 대상</u></span> : 국립금오공대</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;재학생,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">휴학생,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">대학원생</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* 재학증명서 발급 대상자만 해당됨)</span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">재</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">학증명서 서류 기준&gt;</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;시험일로부터</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;3</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">개월 이내 발행된 원본서류</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">국문으로 작성된 재학증명서에 한함</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재학증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재학증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">휴학증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재적증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">수료증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">졸업예정증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">복학증명서 모두 가능</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">서류는 인쇄된 실물(원본)만 가능</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">모바일</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">웹화면 및 캡처본 제시 불가</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. 응시료 할인 혜택</span></span></u><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: 정가 84,000원&nbsp; -&gt;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0p